  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka - Humanitarian mine action and protection against EO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  project will support safe resettlement and recovery in northern Sri Lanka through mine clearance, survey, explosive ordnance disposal, and risk education. Activities will focus on Jaffna, Kilinochchi, and Mullaitivu, where contamination still blocks return, land use, livelihoods, and access to services. The project also includes post-clearance environmental restoration within partnership with a local organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
